Day 24 - Startup Business Strategy Report

Startup Name

StudySync AI

Objective

To evaluate the business viability, revenue potential, customer acquisition strategy, and long-term sustainability of StudySync AI using AI-powered business analysis.

Executive Summary

StudySync AI is an AI-powered study planning platform designed for students. It helps users manage assignments, deadlines, notes, and study schedules through intelligent planning and productivity tools.

The platform targets undergraduate and postgraduate students who struggle with time management, academic stress, and missed deadlines.

Business Reality Check

- Target customers are students aged 18–25.
- Revenue will come through premium subscriptions.
- Customer acquisition will focus on social media, referrals, and campus communities.
- Key risks include competition, retention, and monetization challenges.
- Strong validation is required before scaling.

